<title>UK: TABLE - General Cable Plc year loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - General Cable Plc year loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) loss	 9.6		    vs 8.1 loss</p>
<p> Pretax loss		29.8		   vs 21.2 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   55.7		   vs 30.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Operating loss was 26.2 million stg, including a loss of 5.9 million stg from its acquisition of YCG, versus 20.2 million stg a year earlier.</p>
